# Late-Round Draft Guide is a paid, personal-use-only product — do not commit or
# redistribute. The PDF is also ~72MB, which would permanently bloat git history.
# Keep it local; regenerate the extracted text with reference/extract-guide.sh
*.pdf
reference/late-round-*-text.md

# KTC values are a live market snapshot — regenerate with reference/fetch-ktc.py
# rather than committing a copy that's stale within hours.
reference/ktc-values.json

# Daily snapshot + brief — derived, rebuilt by reference/refresh.py once a day.
# Same rule as ktc-values.json: regenerate, don't commit a stale copy.
reference/snapshot.json
reference/league-brief.md

# macOS noise
.DS_Store
